    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! You won the Canari Quiz Whiz Contest, right?\nWhat a surprise, running into you here!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "As the Quiz Whiz, I’m sure you already know that\nCanari’s partner is Eelektross.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I want to have the same partner Pokémon as her,\nso I’ve been training up some Eelektrik.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All that’s left is to pick the strongest Eelektrik and\nevolve it into Eelektross with a Thunder Stone.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And to think I would run into you at this crucial\nmoment! A miraculous bolt from the blue!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "O Quiz Whiz, please honor me with a battle!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHelp me choose the strongest, most electrifying\nEelektrik!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Once you’re ready to battle, please let me know.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E0063006500200079006F007520190072006500200072006500610064007900200074006F00200062006100740074006C0065002C00200070006C00650061007300650020006C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F0077002E00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "O Quiz Whiz, please honor me with a battle!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHelp me choose the strongest, most electrifying\nEelektrik!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll take you on!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C002000740061006B006500200079006F00750020006F006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not right now",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007200690067006800740020006E006F00770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, of course! I will wait however long you need!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900650073002C0020006F006600200063006F0075007200730065002100200049002000770069006C006C0020007700610069007400200068006F007700650076006500720020006C006F006E006700200079006F00750020006E006500650064002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you! Only a Quiz Whiz of your caliber can\nhelp me choose the strongest Eelektrik!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh no, we’re in a battle zone now!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThere’s no way we can properly focus on having a\ngreat battle here—let’s reconvene later!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wow. Not only are you the Canari Quiz Whiz but\nyou also have exceptional skill in battle!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We may have lost, but I’ve seen enough to decide\nwhich of my Eelektrik I’ll use a Thunder Stone on!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t be a fool, Anguil!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E201900740020006200650020006100200066006F006F006C002C00200041006E006700750069006C002100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mani, sir! Have I done something wrong?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006E0069002C00200073006900720021002000480061007600650020004900200064006F006E006500200073006F006D0065007400680069006E0067002000770072006F006E0067003F00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Canari’s cherished Eelektross wasn’t chosen\nbased on how strong it was as an Eelektrik.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On the contrary, it was a weak Eelektrik that she\ntrained up into the strongest Eelektross!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wh-what? A shocking revelation!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068002D0077006800610074003F00200041002000730068006F0063006B0069006E006700200072006500760065006C006100740069006F006E002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bzzz!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007A007A007A00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A true Canatic adores, appreciates, and accepts all\nof their Eelektrik, regardless of strength!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And you, my dear Quiz Whiz comrade! You have\nmy thanks for sparring with this young Canatic.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come, Anguil—let us train with other Canatics to\nfurther solidify our DYN4MO bonds!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
